tes":"Customer Reply uploaded"},{"title":"Source of funds of business","tag":"Source of Funds","criticality":"High","due":"2025-11-06","description":"Kindly submit enhanced documentation as to how the company and its operations are being funded and by whom, including evidencing of any loans, receivable and/or payable.","notes":"Customer Reply uploaded"},{"title":"Prohibited Countries","tag":"Question","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-06","description":"Since no country of registration is required at registration please advise at what stage players are verified for prohibited countries. (Netherlands was also found in country list of my player account).","notes":"Customer Reply Players are unable to sign up from blocked countries as the website is not accessible to them. Therefore they cannot deposit or withdraw nor play. Netherlands is blocked RCL 15/12 this should be reviewed in line with AML guidelines."},{"title":"Own Games - APPROVED","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-06","description":"It was noticed that the company owns its own games. Please submit RNG and game certificates related to the mentioned games.","notes":"Customer Reply Please see attached RCL Note 19/11/2025: RNG certificate duly submitted. Confirmed and checklist closed."},{"title":"Domains","tag":"Question","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-06","description":"Application states blaze.com and blaze1.space as license domains though jon.bet, jonbet.io and jonbet.com are registered with GCB. Kindly confirm all domains will be live under the GCB license.","notes":"Customer Reply confirmed that all domains will be live"},{"title":"QPA/2024/00881 - Nick Van Gorsel - SOW","tag":"Source of Wealth","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-06","description":"Please certify the SOW and provide certified evidence.","notes":"Customer Reply Nick Van Gorsel’s wealth originates mainly from his personal investment activities and ownership in Black & White Group, the parent company of Blaze, an online gaming platform operating in Brazil. He co-founded the company in 2018, and its rapid growth made it one of the fastest-growing gaming firms in the country. The success of Blaze generated approximately $400 million of his total $403 million net worth, with the remainder held in investment and bank accounts in the Netherlands. Attached you will find all supporting and certified documents."},{"title":"QPA/2024/00880 - Nicholas Beugg - SOW","tag":"Source of Wealth","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-06","description":"Please certify the SOW and provide certified evidence.","notes":"Customer Reply Nicholas Beugg’s wealth originates mainly from his entrepreneurial ventures and investment activities. After starting his investment journey in 2015 by trading U.S. and international equities, his most significant wealth generation came in 2018 when he co-founded Black & White Group (“Blaze”), an online gaming company operating in Brazil. Blaze quickly became one of the fastest-growing online gaming platforms in the country, driving substantial financial success for Beugg. The rapid expansion and profitability of Black & White Group/Blaze form the core of his wealth, complemented by his earlier and ongoing investments in U.S. equities through accounts with firms such as Charles Schwab and Oppenheimer. Attached you will find all supporting and certified documents."},{"title":"QPA/2024/00880 - Nicholas Beugg - PHDF","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-06","description":"The PHDF must be signed and verified digitally. Please resubmit.","notes":"Customer Reply attached signed and verified digitally. Please inform if additional requirements are needed."},{"title":"QPA/2025/04009 - Jamie Kean - Missing Documents","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-08","description":"Please upload all of the documents requested in the application.","notes":null}]}]}]}